{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating journey in this solo racing indie game, uniquely crafted with physics-based flying, exclusively in VR. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through checkpoints to reach the finish line, and here's the twist\u2014pause the timer at any platform to savor the view and appreciate the scenery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, rev up those engines and let the adventure begin! Just make sure you're not afraid of heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Required: <br>A SteamVR HMD and, HTC Controller or Valve Index Controller, or\u00a0<br>Meta Quests 3 and Meta Quest Controller</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719720?t=1750670912","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750670912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750670912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750670912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating journey in this solo racing indie game, uniquely crafted with physics-based flying, exclusively in VR. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through checkpoints to reach the finish line, and here's the twist\u2014pause the timer at any platform to savor the view and appreciate the scenery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, rev up those engines and let the adventure begin! Just make sure you're not afraid of heights!</p><p class=